---
title: "Startup Failure Paths"
config:
  theme: neutral
  look: neo
---
flowchart TD
  start["BesuCommand startup"] --> build["Build controller and runner"]
  build --> failure{"Failure?"}
  failure -->|invalid options| options["Command-line validation error"]
  failure -->|controller construction| controller["Controller startup failure"]
  failure -->|RPC bind/start| rpc["RPC startup failure"]
  failure -->|P2P bind/start| p2p["P2P startup failure"]
  failure -->|synchronizer| sync["Synchronizer failure"]
  failure -->|no| running["Runner main loop"]
  options --> shutdown["Cleanup / exit"]
  controller --> shutdown
  rpc --> shutdown
  p2p --> shutdown
  sync --> shutdown
